#From 1.12 onward, block and item names must be in lang files
#packaged within the jar.
#A copy is provided in millenaire/languages for the translators' convenience,
#but will not be used by Minecraft. It will however be copied within the jar
#when a new Millénaire version is packaged.

#The Translation Gaps calculator however does use the versions in the
#millenaire/language folder, so you can check your progress without
#copying it in the jar


